# The mirror suites of the RonSQL suites are generated: ronsql_jit,
# ronsql_cte_jit and ronsql_fs_jit (the JIT arms), ronsql_cte_ng1r3 /
# ng2r2 / ng2r3 / ng4r2 and ronsql_fs_ng2r2 / ng4r2 (the topology arms).
# suite/ronsql/mirrors/ronsql_mirrors.pl writes their
# t/*.test and r/*.result from the base suites ronsql, ronsql_cte and
# ronsql_fs and from suite/ronsql/mirrors/ronsql_mirrors.cfg, which lists
# the base tests that are not mirrored, each with its reason, and the
# per-test differences (a recorded JIT fallback delta, a test that is not
# strict-armed).
#
# This test runs the script with --check and fails, listing the problems,
# when a mirror file is missing or differs from what the script would
# write (a base test or result changed without the mirrors), when a base
# test has neither a mirror nor an exclude line, or when a mirror suite
# holds a test the config does not account for.  The fix is printed with
# the problems:
#   perl suite/ronsql/mirrors/ronsql_mirrors.pl --write   (from mysql-test/)
# after adding an exclude line to ronsql_mirrors.cfg for a new base test
# that must not be mirrored.

--exec perl $MYSQL_TEST_DIR/suite/ronsql/mirrors/ronsql_mirrors.pl --check
